### Executability review

The architect does not co-sign their own AVP. Inside the {name}-spec engagement
the AVP is judged by reality-checker and test-reviewer in the validate phase,
against a Done-when item of that engagement's criteria.md: every tool in
"Tools required" is reachable, every verification step is machine-runnable
(no "verify it works" hand-waving), and every expected value is concrete.

- Executability review: validate-phase — reality-checker + test-reviewer against the spec engagement's AVP criterion

