## Rollback Strategy

<!-- Required for M/L features. Optional for S features. -->

### Deployment rollback
How to revert the deploy if it fails. E.g.: "Revert commit + redeploy via CI/CD", "Feature flag OFF", "Previous Docker image tag".

### Data rollback
How to handle DB changes if rollback is needed. E.g.: "Down migration reverts schema", "No DB changes", "Data is append-only, no rollback needed".

### Feature flags
Whether feature flags are used. E.g.: "Feature gated behind FF_NEW_SEARCH env var", "Not needed — atomic deploy".

### Rollback verification
How to verify rollback was successful. E.g.: "Run smoke tests against previous version", "Check /health endpoint returns old version".

